+| Accessed 2026-08-15 | Upgrade of Aria Operations 8.18.6 or 8.18.7 to VCF Operations 9.0.x is Unsupported (KB 438994) | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/438994 | An 8.18.6 to 9.0.x in-place PAK upgrade is unsupported. The supported alternative is greenfield VCF Operations 9.0.2 with export/import of dashboards, super metrics, views, and reports; historical time-series data does not migrate. |
+| Accessed 2026-08-15 | How to re-trigger VCF Automation 9.0 failed upgrade workflow (KB 398777) | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/398777 | Aria Automation 8.18.x is first imported into VCF Operations Fleet Management and then upgraded using an upgrade plan. |
+| Accessed 2026-08-15 | Upgrade Guidance for Aria Operations for Logs 8.18.x to VCF Operations for Logs 9.0.x (KB 402314) | https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/402314 | Logs 8.18.x has no in-place 9.0.x upgrade. Deploy fresh, run both versions in parallel, unconfigure old integrations, reconfigure them on target, and transfer no more than 90 days of log data. |
